repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/vcantarella/TrustRegionLeastSquares.jl
url: >-
  https://vcantarella.github.io/TrustRegionLeastSquares.jl
abstract: >-
  A Levenberg-Marquardt trust-region solver for nonlinear
  least squares in Julia, with box constraints via a
  projected step with a generalized Cauchy safeguard,
  minimum-norm steps for underdetermined and rank-deficient
  problems, and Moré's diagonal scaling for badly scaled
  variables. Ships a reproducible benchmark suite comparing
  it against other Julia and Python least-squares solvers.
keywords:
  - julia
  - optimization
  - nonlinear-least-squares
  - levenberg-marquardt
  - trust-region
